{"repo": {"timestamp": 1793662882000, "version": 20002, "name": "5x1 apps", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://apps.5x1.com/fdroid/repo", "description": "BEep for Jibo robots running 5x1, from apps.5x1.com. Includes BEep BETA, which gets every change first. These are the same signed APKs as the website's downloads."}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"authorName": "5x1", "categories": ["Connectivity"], "suggestedVersionCode": "9", "license": "AGPL-3.0-only", "name": "BEep", "summary": "Find and control your Jibo on 5x1", "webSite": "https://apps.5x1.com", "added": 1793658611000, "packageName": "com.jiborevival.beep", "lastUpdated": 1793662882000, "localized": {"en-US": {"description": "BEep finds the Jibo robots on your Wi-Fi and opens BEacon, Jibo's control panel, in the 5x1 look.\n\n\u2022 Finds every Jibo on your Wi-Fi by itself, or connect by IP address\n\u2022 BEacon: status, screen, music, photos, people, the Store and settings\n\u2022 Convert a modded Jibo to 5x1 from your phone\n\nBEep only talks to your robot on your own network, and has no analytics or ads.\n", "phoneScreenshots": ["1-home.png", "2-convert.png"], "whatsNew": "\u2022 A proper app icon that fills your launcher's icon shape, instead of a dark square on a white bubble\n"}}}, {"authorName": "5x1", "categories": ["Connectivity"], "suggestedVersionCode": "7", "license": "AGPL-3.0-only", "name": "BEep BETA", "summary": "Try new BEep features first", "webSite": "https://apps.5x1.com", "added": 1793658611000, "packageName": "com.jiborevival.beep.beta", "lastUpdated": 1793660882000, "localized": {"en-US": {"description": "The newest BEep, published with every change before it reaches BEep. It installs next to BEep and may have bugs.\n\nBEep finds the Jibo robots on your Wi-Fi and opens BEacon, Jibo's control panel, in the 5x1 look, and can convert a modded Jibo to 5x1.\n", "phoneScreenshots": ["1-home.png", "2-convert.png"], "whatsNew": "\u2022 The app icon fills your laun